Package: handwerkerkasse
Version: 1.0.0
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Depends: python3, python3-tk, python3-requests
Maintainer: Mohamed Yassine Hachimi <yassine@example.com>
Description: HandwerkerKasse Desktop Client
 A lightweight desktop application for small craft businesses to
 manage customers, jobs, materials and invoices, with automatic
 profit calculation per job. Connects to the HandwerkerKasse
 FastAPI backend via HTTP.
 